  "narrative": [
    "Three kana-only words: card 1 was graduated two days ago (Easy) and is not due; cards 2 and 3 are new; new goal 1.",
    "Steps 0-1: the summary and the queue at the same instant: same study day, same day end, and the summary's deprecated due counts equal the queue's deprecated counts (both come from one ReviewLoop evaluation).",
    "Step 2: the goal's one new card is answered Easy on the device under test (a local op on the phone, a server op on the server).",
    "Steps 3-4: done_today counts that answer (1 new card, 4200 ms; whether done_today.reviews counts an introduction is the golden's); the queue is done_for_today and the summary's more_available is true (keep going has card 3).",
